.\n\n## Counts\n\n- Wave 1 candidate rows: 25\n- Bbox candidates: 23\n- Produced crop files: 10\n- Produced rows: 9\n- Failed crops: 0\n- Manual-review rows: 16\n- Terminal no-candidate rows: 3\n- Candidate-not-complete/manual-review entries: 13\n- External VLM calls in this PR: 0\n- Student-display eligible rows: 0\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.readback.md`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-wave1-source-crops/**`\n- `scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.mjs`\n- `scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.test.js`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-source-page-renders.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-wave1-execution.test.js`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.mjs --write --render-missing`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-wave1-precise-source-crops.mjs --check`\n- Missing-render replay check: temporarily moved one Wave 1 source-page render, reran `--write --render-missing`, and verified regenerated bytes matched the prior render with `cmp`.\n- Repeated-write stability check: manifest, validator, and sampled crop PNG sha256 unchanged across repeated materializer writes.\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` completed with warning-only branch/ahead posture.\n\n## Blockers\n\nNone.\n","created_at":